<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">- Yaka - Nouveau Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Mukaanda kwaa basi Kolosaayi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kol</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kolosaayi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukaanda a Pawuli kwaa basi Kolosaayi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukaanda kwaa basi Kolosaayi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kolosaayi</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili a mukaanda</para>
  <para style="ip">Kolosaayi ali ngaanda ya mu itinini kia Asia ku peembi ya Wesete, ni itinini kibubaata lolo Turkia. Pawuli ali keni ayamono pe libuundu la mu ngaanda yii. Ni Epafara, mosi mu bambaayi ba Pawuli ba isala, abali libuundu la ku Kolosaayi lii (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 1:7">1.7</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:12">4.12</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Pawuli ayuyi ti, baata bali mu ufutu balibuundu ba ku Kolosaayi. Bo bali mu uha nziisili yahele usuungunu na Ndaa Yimbwe ya Yiisu Kristo. Bo bali mu uleele kwaa basi Kolosaayi mu uduku bifu bia bakaa ba bo, na ukuundu tuu dili mu usala mu tsi yi. Pawuli ali utuu pe uyene ku midieenge mundaa ti, nde ali mu perese ku ngaanda a Looma. Ni mu buu, nde asonii mukaanda wu kwaa basi Kolosaayi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukaanda a Pawuli kwaa basi Kolosaayi li mu ulaa ifwaana kia Kristo, pili mosi, wu Nziaambi asoolo na atsinduu mu uyobolo baata. Ku ngaanda a Kolosaayi, baata koo na boomo ba tuu dili mu utumu tsi yi. Ka bunu, <char style="em">Kristo avulu lituu</char> na tuu dii. Mu likwa la nde nha kuruwa, nde amaasi mifuri mia tuu dii nha yulu a masumu ma baata. Nziaambi amaasi mifuri mia tuu dii bu nde abwiha moonyi kwaa Kristo, mwaana a nde. Kristo li ka mutswe a libuundu, lili weti nyutu mosi ya bangaa ngaa imiini. Nde li mukuutu a bangaa imiini, pili mosi, wuli mu ubiti bo mu idiingi ki inyatii na Nziaambi. Mu kuulu ya libootuu la bo, bangaa imiini bali mu uvuutunu mu likwa na mu idiingi kia Kristo. Bo ka baata ba banyatii.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu ibari kia tsiomi kia mukaanda wu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 1:15-2:5">1.15—2.5</ref></char>), mukuungu mosi li mu uha buzitu kwaa <char style="em">Kristo weti Pfumu a tsi na wa libuundu</char> (<char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 1:15-20">1.15-20</ref></char>). Tswaamina mukuungu wuu ubaanduu, uli na likuundu mu basi Kolosaayi (<char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 1:3-14">1.3-14</ref></char>). Nha mbisi a mukuungu wuu, Pawuli li mu ulibili moonyi mu mudiingi wu nde ali mu udwaana mu ndaa libuundu (<char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 1:24-2:5">1.24—2.5</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Tumake, Pawuli li mu uleele kwaa bangaa Kristo ba ku Kolosaayi mu usa mayele (<char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 2:6-23">2.6-23</ref></char>). Bo a bafwaana pe mu uyuu babali mu uha nziisili ya pia, ka bafwaana ukaanga imiini ki bo bayaki.</para>
  <para style="io">Nha tsieelele, Pawuli li mu uha mandoongi mu uba na <char style="em">ndiaatili yinyatii</char> mutso libuundu, mutso likaanda na nha tso bula (<char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 3:1-4:6">3.1—4.6</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">Pawuli li mu usukusu mukaanda wu mu mabwee matsieelele (<char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 4:7-18">4.7-18</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Mandaa ma Pawuli asonii kwaa basi Kolosaayi, mali mu utsuu kwaa bisi natee mu taanga di. Kristo li mu uyobolo baata kwaa tuu dia mutaata dioosi. Nde li mu ukuulu ka bo mu mandaa moosi mali mu ubee itaata na kabini nha kati a bo.</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1"/>
  <para style="s">Mabwee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1"/>Me Pawuli, wuli tumu a Yiisu Kristo mu litoono la Nziaambi. Me ndi itwaari na mwaana nguu a me Timoteo. <verse eid="COL 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2"/>Bisi disionii mukaanda wu kwaa baana ba nguu babali ba ngira bali ku Kolosaayi, na babali banambata mu itwaari kia bisi na Kristo. Nyaala Nziaambi Taayi a bisi aha beni bweese na iyeenge.<verse eid="COL 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Likuundu la mvutili a matoondo kwaa Nziaambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3"/>Bisi dili mu ubaavutulanga matoondo kwaa Nziaambi, Taayi a Pfumu a bisi Yiisu Kristo, mu taanga di bisi dili mu ubaakuundanga mu ndaa beni. <verse eid="COL 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4"/>Mu ngwanya, bisi diayuyi mamvuungu ma imiini kia beni mu Yiisu Kristo, na ma litoono la beni mu boosi babali ba ngira. <verse eid="COL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5"/>Mu taanga di beni diayuyi Ndaa ya ngwanya mbala ya tsiomi, ni Ndaa Yimbwe, beni diayaabi bi Nziaambi asweeyili beni mu mayula. Imiini kia beni na litoono la beni biadiaalila mu ilimbisi kii. <verse eid="COL 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6"/>Ndaa Yimbwe yili mu utsaamuu na yo yili mu ubutu mbutu mu tsi yoosi yadiengele baata, weti bu yo yasiiri nha kati a beni, umata mu iluumbu ki beni diayuyi yo mbala ya tsiomi. Kii ni iluumbu kia tsiomi ki beni diayuyi bu batsuyi mu bweese ba Nziaambi na beni diayaabi bu bo bali mu ngwanya. <verse eid="COL 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7"/>Ni Epafara, mbaayi a bisi wa isala, ahi beni nziisili yii. Nde li mu usala mu ndaa beni weti musiali wanambata mu Kristo. <verse eid="COL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8"/>Nde ayaabisi bisi buni litoono li Muheebili wa Ngira ali mu utsindi beni mu utonosono.<verse eid="COL 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9"/>Ni mu buu, bisi a dili mu unyaala pe ukuundu mu beni, umata iluumbu ki bisi diayuyi mamvuungu ma beni. Bisi dili mu uloombo kwaa Nziaambi mu uha beni buyeri boosi na mayele ma Muheebili a nde, paa beni diyaaba mandaa ma nde atoono ti beni diyiluu. <verse eid="COL 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10"/>Ni mu buu, beni sa dituu uba na ndiaatili yafwaana nha kulu a Pfumu, mu ubaayiluwanga mandaa ma nde atoono. Beni sa dibutu mbutu dimbwe dia mupili na mupili, na beni sa dikulu mu nziaabili a Nziaambi. <verse eid="COL 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11"/>Bisi dili mu uloombo kwaa nde mu uhamisa beni mu bioosi mu lituu la nde la buzitu, paa beni dibaabaanganga taanga dioosi kutso kinya mu mukonono na kamini a mutimi. <verse eid="COL 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12"/>Divutulu matoondo kwaa Nziaambi Taayi, mu kinya. Nde asi ti beni diba na lituu la uholo ikuku kia mukobo wu nde asweehele kwaa baata ba nde, bali mu udiaata kutso liyalila.<verse eid="COL 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13"/>Mu ngwanya, nde akuuli bisi kwaa lituu la pimisi, na nde aloosi bisi ku Ipfumu kia Mwaana a nde wa litoono. <verse eid="COL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14"/>Ni mu mwaana a nde, nde akuuli bisi mu bubi na asi masumu ma bisi kolokolo.<verse eid="COL 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kristo li Pfumu a bioosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15"/>Kristo ni ifwaani kia Nziaambi wu dili mu uhele umono. Nde li mwaana watsiomi, na nde li nha yulu a biloo bioosi bi Nziaambi ayiluu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:1-3">Yow 1.1-3</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 8:22-26">Mts 8.22-26</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="COL 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16"/>Mundaa ti, ni mu nde Nziaambi ayilii bioosi bili mu mayula na nha tsi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:16">biloo bi dili mu umono na bi dili mu uhele umono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="COL 1:16">butini na bupfumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="COL 1:16">ipfumu na litumu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:16">Nziaambi ayilii bio mu nde na mu ndaa nde.<verse eid="COL 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17"/>Nde akwiba tswaamini bioosi biba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:17">na ni mu nde bioosi bili biadiaala mu mambuu ma bio.<verse eid="COL 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18"/>Nde li mutswe a nyutu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:18">na nyutu ni libuundu.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="COL 1:18">Ni mu nde idiingi ki inyatii ili mu ubaanduu. Nde li Muutu watsiomi, na watsiomi wasimbuu mu baata babakwa, paa nde aba watsiomi mu bioosi. <verse eid="COL 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19"/>Mundaa ti, Nziaambi aholi kesili ya udiaala nde woosi mu Mwaana a nde. <verse eid="COL 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20"/>Mu nde Nziaambi atooni uvuutu iyeenge kia nde na tsi yoosi. Ni mu makila ma Kristo matsiaamii nha kuruwa, nde avuuti iyeenge nha kati a bioosi, bili mu mayula na bili nha tsi.<verse eid="COL 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21"/>Tsiomi, beni ka diali la na Nziaambi, beni diali mitaata mia nde, mu ndaa mamabi ma beni diakitsimi na ma beni diakiyiluu. <verse eid="COL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22"/>Ka mu taanga di, mu likwa lakwi Mwaana a nde mu nyutu ya imuutu, Nziaambi maavutulu iyeenge kia nde na beni. Nde ayilii buu, paa ti beni dimonuu nha kulu a nde weti baata ba nde, bahele na ipii na bahele a toono. <verse eid="COL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23"/>Ka beni diafwaana udiaala mutso imiini, kianambata nha yulu a ibwa kiahama. Kwahele a utakuu na ilimbisi kia beni umata bu beni diayuyi Ndaa Yimbwe. Ndaa Yimbwe yii bayaabisi yo kwaa tsi yoosi yadiengelele baata, na me Pawuli, ndi ka musiali a yo.<verse eid="COL 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isala kia Pawuli mundaa libuundu la Nziaambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24"/>Mu taanga di me ndi na kinya mu mapasi ma me ndi mu umono mu ndaa beni. Mundaa ti, mu nyutu a me, me ndi mu ubweese mapasi mamakeni mu uhele mu mapasi ma Kristo mu nyutu a nde, yili libuundu. <verse eid="COL 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25"/>Me ka musiali a libuundu, weti buli isala ki Nziaambi ahi me mu ndaa beni. Mono, isala me ki nde atumu me, ni kia uyaabisa beni Ndaa nde yoosi Yimbwe. <verse eid="COL 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26"/>Ndaa me yii, ni matsweeyi ma nde aswee kwaa bisieende bioosi umata bele pe, ka ma nde ayaabisi kwaa baata ba nde mu taanga di. <verse eid="COL 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27"/>Mundaa ti Nziaambi atooni umweese kwaa beni, matsweeyi ma, maluulu mu busini na mu bubwe, ma nde ayiluu mu ndaa bifuumbu bioosi. Mono matsweeyi me ni ma: Kristo li mu beni, na nde li mu uha beni ilimbisi ti, beni sa dibaa ikuku kia buzitu ba Nziaambi. <verse eid="COL 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28"/>Bisi dili mu uyaabisa Kristo kwaa pasi muutu. Bisi dili mu udutu matswi ma pasi muutu, na dili mu uyiisi pasi muutu mu buyeri bafwaana, paa pasi muutu akulu mu muheebili, mu itwaari na Kristo. <verse eid="COL 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29"/>Ni mu buu, me ndi mu usala na udwaana mu mifuri mili mu umata kwaa Kristo, wuli mu usala mu me mu lituu.<verse eid="COL 1:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1"/>Me natoono ti beni diyaaba buni buli pasi dia mudiingi wa mifuri wu me ndi mu udwaana mu ndaa beni, mu ndaa bangaa Kristo bali ku ngaanda a Laodise, na mu ndaa baata bakimi babahele uyaaba me. <verse eid="COL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2"/>Me natoono ti mitimi mia bo miluulu mu pamini, na ti bo bakangama mu litoono, na baluulu mu busini mu ilimbisi kioosi kili mu uha mayele ma ngwanya. Bo sa batuu uyaaba matsweeyi ma Nziaambi, pili mosi Kristo nde makulu: <verse eid="COL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3"/>mu nde muli mwasweeme busini boosi ba buyeri na ba nziaabili. <verse eid="COL 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4"/>Me ndi mu uleele beni buu, paa ti muutu so mosi anyaala beni ufutu mu tsuyili a nde yimbwe. <verse eid="COL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5"/>So me ndi la na beni mu imuutu, ka mu matsimi ma me, me ndi bebele na beni. Na me ndi na kinya mu uyaaba ti, beni diahama na diakangama mu imiini mu Kristo.<verse eid="COL 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Uba babakangama mu Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6"/>Ni mu buu, bu beni diasiingi Yiisu Kristo weti Pfumu, didiaata mu itwaari na nde. <verse eid="COL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7"/>Dimene miaanzi mu nde na dituungu idiingi kia beni kioosi mu nde. Diba babahama mu imiini taanga dioosi, weti buli nziisili yi beni diaholo, na diluulu mu mvutili a matoondo.<verse eid="COL 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8"/>Disa mayele paa ti muutu so mosi anyaala ufutu beni, mu nziisili ya pia na yahele na buyeri. Yo yili yadiaalila nha yulu a bukulu ba baata, nha yulu a miheebili mili mu utumu tsi, ka a nha yulu a Kristo pe. <verse eid="COL 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9"/>Ka bioosi bili mu Nziaambi, biakuu mu nyutu a Kristo, na bili mu udiaala mu nde, <verse eid="COL 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10"/>na mu ndaa itwaari kia beni na Kristo, beni diayaki biloo bioosi bi beni dili na nzala a bio. Mundaa ti, nde ni wuli mu utumu tuu dioosi, na bipfumu bioosi. <verse eid="COL 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11"/>Mu itwaari na nde, bakesi beni, ka a mu kesili ya mu mioo mia baata pe, ka mu kesili yamati kwaa Kristo, na yakuuli bisi mu nyutu a bisi ya masumu. <verse eid="COL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12"/>Mu ngwanya, mu taanga di beni diaholi libootuu, badii beni na Kristo, na beni diasiimbii ka na nde. Maa mayilimi buu, mundaa ti beni diasi imiini mu lituu la Nziaambi la siimbili nde mu babakwa. <verse eid="COL 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13"/>Mu taanga dikulu, beni diali diakwa mundaa mamabi ma beni. Beni ali keni a bakese pe na beni ali bangooyi. Ka mu taanga di, Nziaambi maabwaha beni moonyi na Kristo. Nde wadisi kolokolo mu masumu ma bisi moosi. <verse eid="COL 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14"/>Nde akuungili mukaanda wakisieembe bisi nha kulu a mikele. Mukaanda wuu akitungululu bisi mu ndaa tumini diali mu nde. Nde amaasi mukaanda wuu, bu akomi nde nha kuruwa. <verse eid="COL 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15"/>Nziaambi amaasi mifuri mia bipfumu na tuu dia miheebili mimibi. Nde ayangi miheebili mii nha kulu a baata boosi, na nde adieengisi mio weti makori, mu mbiingili a mwaana nde.<verse eid="COL 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16"/>Ni mu buu, a dinyaala pe ti baata bafuundusu beni mundaa bi beni didia so bi beni dinywa, so mundaa yatala mikuungi, so miaba mia mbiyili a tsuungi, so a buu pe mia iluumbu kia Saba. <verse eid="COL 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17"/>Bii bioosi bili iziimi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">iziimi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">utuu uleele ka ifwaani</char></note> kia mandaa makaayira. Ka ngwanya ni Kristo. <verse eid="COL 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18"/>A dinyaala pe ti baata bali mu umonuu ti bo bakuluu, babali mu ukuundu batumu ba Nziaambi na babali mu uha ndutu mu monini a bo, bafuundusu beni. Baata bapili yii bali baluulu mu liwaa la paamba mu matsimi ma bo ma imuutu. <verse eid="COL 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19"/>Bo a bakangama pe mu Kristo, wuli mutswe a nyutu. Ka bunu, mundaa Kristo nyutu yoosi yili mu ubaa biloo na yo yili yavuutunu bubwe mu mikangi na binama, na yo yili mu ukulu weti bu Nziaambi atoono.<verse eid="COL 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20"/>Beni diakwa na Kristo, na beni diakuulii kwaa lituu la miheebili mimibi mia tsi. Ka mu ima beni dili mu udiaata weti baata bali ku tsini a litumu la tsi yi? Beni dili mu usiingi ti babamuu beni mu pili a mikele mi: <verse eid="COL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21"/>«A holo biinabi pe», «A biimbi bio pe», «A beembe bio pe». <verse eid="COL 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22"/>Mio miatala biloo bili mu ufuu mu taanga di baata bali mu usalila bio, mundaa ti mio mili mikele na nziisili a imuutu. <verse eid="COL 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23"/>Ngwanya, mikele mii mili mu umonuu weti mikele mia buyeri, mundaa ti mio mili mu utsuu mu inziaambi ki muutu nde makulu atoono, mu umonuu wakuluu na mu umweese nyutu a nde makulu pasi. Ka mio a mili na ndutu so hoolo pe, so a ndila mu uyuutusu manzala ma imuutu pe.<verse eid="COL 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1"/>Beni diasimbii mu likwa mu uba moonyi na Kristo. Ni mu buu, disaa biloo bili ku yula, kuu kuli mu udiaala Kristo nha koo kia babaala kia Nziaambi. <verse eid="COL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2"/>Diba na tari mu biloo bili ku yula, ka a mu biloo bili nha tsi pe. <verse eid="COL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3"/>Ka beni dili diakwa, na moonyi a beni li asweeme na Kristo mu Nziaambi. <verse eid="COL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4"/>Kristo ni moonyi a beni wa ngwanya. Na mu taanga di nde akaamonuu, beni ka sa dimonuu na nde, mu uba itwaari mu buzitu ba nde.<verse eid="COL 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ndiaatili yinyati mu Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5"/>Ni mu buu, didusu bioosi bili bia tsi mu beni: ndiaatili ya butsa-butsa, tsumiyi, manzala ma mandaa matsionyi, manzala mamabi na nyiingi, mundaa ti nyiingi, ni kuundila biteyi. <verse eid="COL 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6"/>Maa ni mandaa mamabi mali mu uta kesi a Nziaambi mbili nha yulu a baata bali muhele utumumu nde. <verse eid="COL 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7"/>Buu ni bu beni diaki diaata tsiomi, mu taanga di idiingi kia beni kiali ku tsini a litumu la masumu ma. <verse eid="COL 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8"/>Ka mu taanga di, dibumu bii bioosi: kesi, fuukiri na mandaa mamabi. Nyaala ituyi so imosi, so ndaa ya tsionyi inyaala upala mu munywa a beni. <verse eid="COL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9"/>A difutu pia pe bana mu bana, mundaa ti beni diamaabwoongolo imuutu kia beni ki ikulu na bifu bia kio. <verse eid="COL 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10"/>Na beni diamaabwalwaata imuutu ki inyatii. Beni dili biyiluu bibinyatii, bi Nziaambi Muyili a bisi, ali mu ukitisanga mu ifwaani kia nde taanga dioosi, paa beni diyiluu uyaaba nde mu iteesi kia kuu. <verse eid="COL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11"/>A yabwasaala na lisoboso pe nha kati a Muyuudayo na wuli a Muyuudayo pe, nha kati a wubakese na wubahele ukese, nha kati a mweenyi na musienzi, nha kati a mutee na muutu wuli bunyanga. Ka ndaa yavulu ndutu, ni Kristo wuli bioosi mu boosi.<verse eid="COL 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12"/>Beni dili baata ba Nziaambi; Nziaambi asoolo beni na nde atoono beni. Ni mu buu, beni diafwaana ulwaata matsimi maluulu mu ngebe, mutimi wumubwe, wakuluu, wabuleembi, na kamini a mutimi. <verse eid="COL 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13"/>Diba na kamini a mutimi bana mu bana. Na so muutu li na toono na mbaayi, dilombosono kolokolo bana mu bana, weti bu Pfumu asi beni kolokolo. <verse eid="COL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14"/>Na nha yulu a bioosi, dilwaata litoono, lo ni musiingi wukaabaasila beni mu uba na itwaari kiakuu.<verse eid="COL 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15"/>Nyaala iyeenge kia Kristo itumu mitimi mia beni! Mu ngwanya, ni mu iyeenge kii Nziaambi ati beni mbila, weti binama bia nyutu mosi. Diba na ipfu kia uvutulu matoondo. <verse eid="COL 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16"/>Nyaala mandaa ma Kristo, na busini ba mo boosi, madiaala mu beni. Diyiisini bana mu bana, na dihelesene mandoongi bana mu bana mu buyeri boosi. Mu mvutili a matoondo, diyimbili Nziaambi mikuungu na biyimbi bia muheebili bia mupili na mupili, mutimi a beni woosi. <verse eid="COL 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17"/>Mioosi mi beni diyiluu, mu mandaa, so mu biyiluu, diyiluu mio mu kuumbu a Pfumu Yiisu, mu uvutulu matoondo kwaa Nziaambi Taayi mu nde.<verse eid="COL 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nziisili mu yatala kaanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18"/>Beni bakari, dikuluu kwaa balumi ba beni, weti bu beni diafwaana uyiluu nha kulu a Pfumu. <verse eid="COL 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19"/>Beni balumi, ditoono bakari ba beni, na a dikolo bo makesi pe. <verse eid="COL 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20"/>Beni baana, ditumumu bataayi na banguu ba beni mu mandaa moosi, mundaa ti buu ni bu Pfumu atoono. <verse eid="COL 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21"/>Beni bataayi, a dikoloso baana ba beni makesi pe, leeti bo sa bavutuu mbisi. <verse eid="COL 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22"/>Beni batee, ditumumu bapfumu ba beni ba nha tsi nha mu bioosi. A disa buu pe, ndila mu taanga di beni dili nha kulu a bo, mu uha bo kinyi. Ka ditumumu bo mu mutimi mosi, mundaa likiinzi li beni dili na lo mu Pfumu. <verse eid="COL 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23"/>Pasi bu ili isala kia beni, disa kio mu mutimi a beni woosi, weti beni dili mu usalila Pfumu, ka a baata pe. <verse eid="COL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24"/>Dilibili moonyi ti Pfumu sa asieende beni: beni sa ditolo mukobo wu nde asweehele kwaa baba nde. Mundaa ti, Pfumu wa ngwanya wu beni dili mu usalila, ni Kristo. <verse eid="COL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25"/>Ka wu uyiluu mamabi sa afutu masumu, mundaa ti Nziaambi a ali na tala-kiinzi pe.<verse eid="COL 3:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1"/>Beni bapfumu, diyiluu mandaa mamabwe na masuungunu kwaa batee ba beni. Dilibili moonyi ti, beni ka dili na Pfumu mu mayula.<verse eid="COL 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tumimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2"/>Dihama mu likuundu, diba likanda mu likuundu li beni dili mu usa kwaa Nziaambi mu mvutili a matoondo. <verse eid="COL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3"/>Mu diina taanga dii, dikuundu ka mu bisi, paa ti Nziaambi aha bisi taanga diafwaana mu uyiisi mandaa ma nde, mu uyaabisa matsweeyi ma Kristo. Mu ngwanya, ni mu ndaa yii me ndi mu perese mu taanga di. <verse eid="COL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4"/>Ni mu buu, dikuundu paa ti me tuu utsuu mu matsweeyi ma, na uyaabisa mo na yaki-yaki weti bwafwaana.<verse eid="COL 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5"/>Didiaata mu buyeri nha kati a bali a bangaa Kristo pe, na disalila taanga dili nha kulu a beni. <verse eid="COL 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6"/>Nyaala mandaa ma beni dibaaleelanga taanga dioosi mabaabaanganga mamabwe na muswele. Diyaaba buni beni diafwaana uvutulu mamvutu kwaa pasi nde mu beni.<verse eid="COL 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mabwee ma tsieelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7"/>Tisikusi, nduu a bisi, wuli mwaana a nguu wa litoono na musiali wahama mu isala kia Pfumu, sa ayaabisa beni mioosi miatala me. <verse eid="COL 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8"/>Me nitsinduu nde kwaa beni, paa ti, ya kati a tsiomi, nde ayaabisa beni mapolo ma bisi, na tumake, nde ahamisa beni. <verse eid="COL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9"/>Nde sa ayiri na Onezimi, mwaana nguu wahama mu imiini na wa litoono ndaa, wuli mosi mu beni. Bo sa bayaabisa beni mioosi mili mu ulabuu kuni.<verse eid="COL 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10"/>Arisitariki, wuli mu perese na me, tsindii beni mabwee. Malako ka, mwaana a nguu a Barnaba, tsindii beni mabwee ka. Beni diamaakwaholo tumini mu ndaa yatala Malako: so nde yiri kwaa beni, diyaka nde bubwe. <verse eid="COL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11"/>Yiisu wuli kuumbu ya ubili Yutuse, heeri ka beni mabwee. Ndila babaala batata ba, mu bangaa Kristo ba Bayuudayo, bali mu usala na me nha, mu ndaa Ipfumu kia Nziaambi. Bo bakihamisa me kwalaa. <verse eid="COL 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12"/>Epafara, wuli ka musi nzo a beni, heeri beni mabwee. Nde wuli ka musiali a Yiisu Kristo, a ali mu unyaala pe ukuundu mu beni mu iteesi kialaa, paa ti beni diba babahama, babakulu mu muheebili na babaholi kesili ya uyiluu litoono la Nziaambi mu mioosi. <verse eid="COL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13"/>Me utuu uta imbaangi ki mu nde: nde li mu umono pasi dialaa mundaa beni, mundaa babali ku ngaanda ya Lawodikia na mundaa babali ku Iyerapolisi. <verse eid="COL 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14"/>Luuka, mbaayi a bisi wuli mubuyi, na Demaso baheeri beni mabwee.<verse eid="COL 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15"/>Diha mabwee kwaa baana ba nguu babali ku Lawodikia, na kwaa Nifa na libuundu lili mu ukukunu ku nzo a nde. <verse eid="COL 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16"/>Nha beni dikaamana utaanga mukaanda wu, ditsinduu nde kwaa libuundu la ku ngaanda Lawodikia, na beni bame ka, ditaanga mukaanda wukaamata kwaa bo. <verse eid="COL 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17"/>Dileele kwaa Arisipe, nde afwaana uyiluu ukuusu mufunu wubaha nde mu isala kia Pfumu. <verse eid="COL 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18"/>Mu koo kia me makulu me ndi mu usonuu mandaa ma: mabwee ma beni. A di diimbili pe ti me ndi mu perese. Nyaala bweese ba Nziaambi baba na beni.<verse eid="COL 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4"/>
</usx>
